  "subject": "Action-required: execute the renderer source move from github.com/catdef/catdef.org to catdef-spec/renderer/ per CA-016; pre-submission listing copy on the catdef-plugin README already updated to generic 'github.com/catdef/catdef-spec' wording (catdef-spec README does not carry the affected bullet so no edit there); no urgency on the code move itself but render.catdef.org's deploy needs to start pulling from the new canonical source location once available; status memo back when complete with deploy-pull mechanism chosen + live verification",

